    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in an abandoned laboratory where every step could be your last. Riddles that challenge logic, frightening sounds from the darkness and an ever-changing atmosphere force you to keep your finger on the pulse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not alone. You are being hunted by a monster - a predator lurking in the shadows, and an elite squad of mercenaries ready to destroy anyone who gets in their way. You have a choice: survive by fighting, or try to outsmart your enemies by hiding and relying on your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect first aid kits and useful devices. Solve puzzles to move forward, but be prepared: every mistake can cost you your life. And when the monster is close, your vision narrows, the music swells, and you understand - there is no choice, run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive all the horrors of the laboratory and find a way out, or will the darkness swallow you forever? Test your courage and logic in a game that keeps you in suspense from the first to the last moment.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in an abandoned laboratory where every step could be your last. Riddles that challenge logic, frightening sounds from the darkness and an ever-changing atmosphere force you to keep your finger on the pulse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not alone. You are being hunted by a monster - a predator lurking in the shadows, and an elite squad of mercenaries ready to destroy anyone who gets in their way. You have a choice: survive by fighting, or try to outsmart your enemies by hiding and relying on your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect first aid kits and useful devices. Solve puzzles to move forward, but be prepared: every mistake can cost you your life. And when the monster is close, your vision narrows, the music swells, and you understand - there is no choice, run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive all the horrors of the laboratory and find a way out, or will the darkness swallow you forever? Test your courage and logic in a game that keeps you in suspense from the first to the last moment.</p>",
    "short_description": "Escape the lab and survive through dangerous monsters and military personnel",
